  Install skill,npx skills add https://github.com/akillness/jeo-skills --skill game-ui-ux
  Validate example,python3 .agent-skills/game-ui-ux/scripts/validate-game-ui.py .agent-skills/game-ui-ux/references/contract-example.json
  Self-test validator,python3 .agent-skills/game-ui-ux/scripts/validate-game-ui.py --self-test
  Validate skill,bash .agent-skills/skill-standardization/scripts/validate_skill.sh .agent-skills/game-ui-ux
